  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of lifestyle living without sacrificing convenience. Set on a private, north facing 5,722m² site surrounded by neighbouring farmland, this appealing property combines generous family living, resort style outdoor facilities and the added advantage of a fully appointed granny flat.\r\n\r\nThe single level main home of generous proportions, offers separate living areas, high stud ceilings and an easy flow, creating an inviting setting for family life and entertaining. A wood burner adds warmth and atmosphere during the cooler months, while the separate granny flat provides excellent flexibility for extended family, guests or independent living.\r\n\r\nOutside, the focus is firmly on enjoying the lifestyle. A large heated swimming pool, spa pool, golf putting green and petanque court create an ideal setting for summer entertaining and leisurely afternoons with family and friends. Established fruit trees add to the appeal, while the extensive flat lawn areas provide plenty of room for children to play, outdoor activities or simply enjoying the open space. With ample parking for vehicles, boats, trailers and visitors, practicality is well catered for too.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this property particularly appealing is its location. Enjoy the privacy and space of your own lifestyle setting, approximately 10 minutes drive to Silverdale, cafés and amenities, with the park and ride and northern motorway access close at hand. It’s a highly desirable combination of country style living and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re accommodating extended family, looking for room to spread out or ready to embrace a more relaxed way of life, this property offers an appealing blend of space, privacy and versatility.\r\n\r\nMy owners are committed to achieving a sale and invite your inspection. Discover a lifestyle property where resort style relaxation meets a genuinely convenient location.",
